    <node id="9e0a7e7e-f1b3-4926-a140-30a6fd72433c">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Group Life Insurance Certificate","text":"╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║            GROUP TERM LIFE INSURANCE CERTIFICATE                  ║\n║            Alliance Group Benefits                                ║\n╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nCertificate No: AGB-GT-2024-TechCorp-00842\nMaster Policy No: AGB-2024-TC-GROUP\nIssue Date: June 1, 2024\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nCERTIFICATE HOLDER (Employee)\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nName: Alex Morgan Taylor\nEmployee ID: TC-8842\nDepartment: Software Engineering\nDate of Birth: February 14, 1990\nDate of Hire: March 1, 2022\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nEMPLOYER (Policyholder)\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nTechCorp Industries, Inc.\nCorporate Headquarters: San Jose, California\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nCOVERAGE SUMMARY\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nBasic Life Insurance: 2x Annual Salary = $180,000\nVoluntary Additional Coverage: $100,000 (employee-elected)\nTotal Coverage: $280,000\n\nEffective Date: June 1, 2024\n","summary":"This document certifies group term life insurance coverage for Alex Morgan Taylor, an employee at TechCorp Industries, effective June 1, 2024. Basic coverage equals twice the annual salary ($180,000), with an additional $100,000 elected voluntarily, resulting in total coverage of $280,000. The master policy is administered by Alliance Group Benefits, and the certificate serves as official documentation of the employee’s benefit entitlements.","topics":["Life Insurance","Employer Benefits","Group Policy","Employee Coverage"],"facts":[{"name":"Certificate Holder Name","sentence":"The certificate holder's name is Alex Morgan Taylor.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Certificate Holder","Employee Information","Name Verification"],"entities":[{"name":"Alex Morgan Taylor","type":"PERSON","role":"Certificate Holder (Employee)","relational_anchors":["TC-8842"]},{"name":"TechCorp Industries, Inc.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"Employer (Policyholder)","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Group Term Life Insurance Certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"Insurance Document Issued","relational_anchors":["AGB-GT-2024-TechCorp-00842","AGB-2024-TC-GROUP"]},{"name":"Basic Life Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Primary Coverage Amount","relational_anchors":["$180,000","2x Annual Salary"]},{"name":"Voluntary Additional Coverage","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Supplementary Employee-Elected Coverage","relational_anchors":["$100,000"]},{"name":"Total Coverage","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Combined Insured Value","relational_anchors":["$280,000"]},{"name":"June 1, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"Effective Date of Coverage","relational_anchors":["Issue Date: June 1, 2024"]},{"name":"San Jose, California","type":"LOCATION","role":"Corporate Headquarters Location","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Employee ID Verification","sentence":"The employee ID of the certificate holder is TC-8842.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Employee ID","Certificate Holder","TechCorp Industries"],"entities":[{"name":"Alex Morgan Taylor","type":"PERSON","role":"Certificate Holder (Employee)","relational_anchors":["TC-8842"]},{"name":"TechCorp Industries, Inc.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"Employer (Policyholder)","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Group Term Life Insurance Certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"Insurance Document Issued","relational_anchors":["AGB-GT-2024-TechCorp-00842","AGB-2024-TC-GROUP"]},{"name":"Basic Life Insurance","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Primary Coverage Amount","relational_anchors":["$180,000","2x Annual Salary"]},{"name":"Voluntary Additional Coverage","type":"CONCEPT","role":"Supplementary Employee-Elected Coverage","r