      <data key="d0">{"name":"Group Life Insurance Summary","text":"180,000\nVoluntary Additional Coverage: $100,000 (employee-elected)\nTotal Coverage: $280,000\n\nEffective Date: June 1, 2024\nPremium Contribution: Employer pays basic; employee pays $12/month \n                      for voluntary coverage\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nDESIGNATED BENEFICIARY\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPrimary: Jordan Casey Taylor (Spouse) - 100%\nContingent: Taylor Family Revocable Trust - 100%\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 1 - ABOUT THIS CERTIFICATE\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n1.1 This certificate is evidence of coverage under the Master \n    Group Policy issued to your employer.\n\n1.2 The Master Policy controls in case of any conflict with this \n    certificate.\n\n1.3 Your coverage is subject to the terms, conditions, and \n    exclusions in the Master Policy and this certificate.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 2 - ELIGIBILITY AND EFFECTIVE DATE\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n2.1 You became eligible for coverage on your date of hire.\n\n2.2 Basic coverage became effective automatically without \n    requiring evidence of insurability.\n\n2.3 Voluntary coverage required enrollment within 31 days of hire \n    (Late Entrant provisions apply if enrolling after 31 days).\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 3 - BENEFIT AMOUNT CALCULATION\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n3.1 BASIC LIFE: Your basic benefit equals 2 times your annual \n    base salary, rounded to the next higher $1,000.\n\n3.2 VOLUNTARY SUPPLEMENTAL: You may elect additional coverage in \n    increments of $10,000, up to a maximum of 5 times salary.\n\n3.3 SALARY CHANGES: Your basic benefit will be recalculated \n    annually on your policy anniversary based on","summary":"This document provides a detailed overview of an employee’s group life insurance coverage, including a total benefit amount of $280,000 composed of $180,000 in basic coverage and $100,000 in voluntarily elected supplemental coverage. Coverage began on June 1, 2024, with the employer paying for basic coverage and the employee contributing $12 monthly for the voluntary portion. Eligibility started at hire, with specific enrollment windows and recalculation tied to annual salary changes. Primary beneficiaries are designated as spouse Jordan Casey Taylor, with contingent rights held by the Taylor Family Revocable Trust.","topics":["Life Insurance","Employee Benefits","Coverage Details","Beneficiary Designation"],"facts":[{"name":"Total Coverage Amount","sentence":"The total coverage amount is $280,000.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["total coverage","basic life insurance","voluntary supplemental"],"entities":[{"name":"180,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"basic life benefit amount","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$100,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"voluntary supplemental coverage elected by employee","relational_anchors":["Voluntary Additional Coverage"]},{"name":"$280,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"total combined coverage amount","relational_anchors":["Total Coverage"]},{"name":"June 1, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"effective start date of coverage","relational_anchors":["Effective Date"]},{"name":"$12/month","type":"AMOUNT","role":"monthly premium paid by employee","relational_anchors":["Premium Contribution"]},{"name":"Jordan Casey Taylor","type":"PERSON","role":"primary designated beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Spouse"]},{"name":"Taylor Family Revocable Trust","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"contingent designated beneficiary","relational_anchors":["Contingent"]},{"name":"Master Group Policy","type":"CONCEPT","role":"underlying controlling insurance agreement","relational_