      <data key="d0">{"name":"Group Life Insurance Terms","text":" elect additional coverage in \n    increments of $10,000, up to a maximum of 5 times salary.\n\n3.3 SALARY CHANGES: Your basic benefit will be recalculated \n    annually on your policy anniversary based on your current \n    salary.\n\n3.4 MAXIMUM BENEFIT: Total coverage cannot exceed $1,000,000.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 4 - WHEN COVERAGE ENDS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n4.1 Your coverage terminates on the earliest of:\n    (a) The date the Master Policy terminates\n    (b) The last day of the month in which you cease to be an \n        eligible employee\n    (c) The date you cease active full-time employment\n    (d) The date you request termination of voluntary coverage\n    (e) The last day for which required premiums have been paid\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 5 - CONVERSION PRIVILEGE\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n5.1 If your group coverage terminates for any reason except \n    non-payment of premium, you may convert to an individual \n    whole life policy without evidence of insurability.\n\n5.2 You must apply for conversion within 31 days of termination.\n\n5.3 The conversion policy will be issued at:\n    • Your attained age at conversion\n    • Standard premium rates for the individual policy\n    • Maximum amount: Lesser of group coverage or $200,000\n\n5.4 No medical exam or health questions required for conversion.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 6 - PORTABILITY\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n6.1 If you leave employment, you may port your coverage by \n    continuing it as an individual policy.\n\n6.2 Ported coverage continues at the same amount you had under \n    the group policy.\n\n6.3 You must apply within 31 days of termination of employment.\n\n6.4 Premium rates will be age-banded group rates, payable directly \n    to the insurance company.\n\n6.5 Evidence of insurability is NOT required for portability.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 7 - ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT\n────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────","summary":"This document details terms of a group life insurance plan, specifying annual recalculation of benefits based on salary, a cap of $1 million in total coverage, and eligibility rules tied to employment status. Coverage ends if employment ceases, premiums lapse, or the master policy terminates. Participants can convert their group coverage to an individual whole life policy within 31 days of termination—without proof of insurability—and receive up to $200,000 or their former group limit. Alternatively, they may port coverage to an individual policy under similar terms, also without medical exams, provided application occurs within 31 days of job separation.","topics":["Life Insurance","Coverage Termination","Conversion Privilege","Portability"],"facts":[{"name":"Maximum Coverage Limit","sentence":"The maximum total coverage cannot exceed $1,000,000.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["maximum coverage","benefit cap","total coverage limit"],"entities":[{"name":"additional coverage","type":"CONCEPT","role":"incremental increase option","relational_anchors":["increments of $10,000"]},{"name":"maximum benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"upper limit on total coverage","relational_anchors":["$1,000,000"]},{"name":"policy anniversary","type":"DATE","role":"annual recalculation trigger","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"salary changes","type":"CONCEPT","role":"basis for annual benefit adjustment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"coverage ends","type":"CONCEPT","role":"termination condition set","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"last day of the month in which you cease to be an eligible employee","type":"DATE","role":"eligibility end deadline","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"conversion privilege","type":"CONCEPT","role":"right to switch policies post-termination","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 31 days of termination","type":"DATE","role":"application window for conversion","relational_anchors":["31 days"]},{"name":"individual whole life policy","type":"CONCEPT","role":"post-conversion policy form","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$200,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"max conversion policy size","relational_anchors":["Maximum amount: Lesser of group coverage or $200,000"]},{"name":"portability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"continuation after leaving employment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 31 days of termination of employment","type":"DATE","role":"deadline for applying to port coverage","relational_anchors":["31 days"]},{"name":"accelerated death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"early payout feature upon qualifying event","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Election Increments","sentence":"Additional coverage can be elected in increments of $10,000.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["coverage increments","additional coverage","salary-based limits"],"entities":[{"name":"additional coverage","type":"CONCEPT","role":"incremental increase option","relational_anchors":["increments of $10,000"]},{"name":"maximum benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"upper limit on total coverage","relational_anchors":["$1,000,000"]},{"name":"policy anniversary","type":"DATE","role":"annual recalculation trigger","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"salary changes","type":"CONCEPT","role":"basis for annual benefit adjustment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"coverage ends","type":"CONCEPT","role":"termination condition set","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"last day of the month in which you cease to be an eligible employee","type":"DATE","role":"eligibility end deadline","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"conversion privilege","type":"CONCEPT","role":"right to switch policies post-termination","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 31 days of termination","type":"DATE","role":"application window for conversion","relational_anchors":["31 days"]},{"name":"individual whole life policy","type":"CONCEPT","role":"post-conversion policy form","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$200,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"max conversion policy size","relational_anchors":["Maximum amount: Lesser of group coverage or $200,000"]},{"name":"portability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"continuation after leaving employment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 31 days of termination of employment","type":"DATE","role":"deadline for applying to port coverage","relational_anchors":["31 days"]},{"name":"accelerated death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"early payout feature upon qualifying event","relational_anchors":[]}]},{"name":"Max Elective Coverage Limit","sentence":"Maximum elective coverage is limited to five times the employee's salary.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["elective coverage","salary multiple","coverage limits"],"entities":[{"name":"additional coverage","type":"CONCEPT","role":"incremental increase option","relational_anchors":["increments of $10,000"]},{"name":"maximum benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"upper limit on total coverage","relational_anchors":["$1,000,000"]},{"name":"policy anniversary","type":"DATE","role":"annual recalculation trigger","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"salary changes","type":"CONCEPT","role":"basis for annual benefit adjustment","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"coverage ends","type":"CONCEPT","role":"termination condition set","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"last day of the month in which you cease to be an eligible employee","type":"DATE","role":"eligibility end deadline","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"conversion privilege","type":"CONCEPT","role":"right to switch policies post-termination","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 31 days of termination","type":"DATE","role":"application window for