    <node id="bd688ca8-80f4-4512-ae29-82bd639113aa">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Group Life Insurance Terms","text":" insurance company.\n\n6.5 Evidence of insurability is NOT required for portability.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 7 - ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n7.1 If you are diagnosed with a terminal illness with life \n    expectancy of 12 months or less, you may request acceleration \n    of up to 75% of your death benefit.\n\n7.2 Minimum acceleration: $5,000\n    Maximum acceleration: $250,000\n\n7.3 Accelerated amount will be reduced by an actuarial discount.\n\n7.4 Any amount accelerated reduces the death benefit payable to \n    beneficiaries.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 8 - EXCLUSIONS AND LIMITATIONS\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n8.1 SUICIDE: If death occurs by suicide within 12 months of the \n    coverage effective date, we will not pay a death benefit.\n\n8.2 PRE-EXISTING CONDITION LIMITATION: None. Group coverage has \n    no pre-existing condition exclusions.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 9 - BENEFICIARY DESIGNATION\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n9.1 You may change your beneficiary at any time by submitting a \n    change form to your employer's HR department.\n\n9.2 If no beneficiary survives you, benefits will be paid to \n    your estate.\n\n9.3 If you name multiple beneficiaries, benefits are divided \n    equally unless you specify percentages.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 10 - FILING A CLAIM\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n10.1 Beneficiaries should notify Alliance Group Benefits \n     immediately upon death of the insured employee.\n\n10.2 Required documents:\n     • Completed claim form (available from employer or insurer)\n     • Certified death certificate\n     • Proof of beneficiary identity\n\n10.3 Submit claims to:\n     Alliance Group Benefits - Claims Department\n     1200 Insurance Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201\n     Claims Hotline: 1-888-555-CLAIM\n\n10.4 Benefits will be paid within 10 business days of receipt of \n     complete","summary":"This document describes essential features of a group life insurance plan, including that proof of insurability is not needed when transferring coverage (portability). It allows terminally ill individuals to receive up to 75% of their death benefit—between $5,000 and $250,000—with an actuarial reduction; any advance lowers the final payout. Key exclusions include suicide within the first year, though there are no pre-existing condition limits. Beneficiaries can be changed anytime via HR, split equally unless otherwise specified, and if none survive, proceeds go to the estate. Claims require a completed form, certified death certificate, and identification, submitted to Alliance Group Benefits, with payment expected within ten business days of receiving full documentation.","topics":["Life Insurance","Death Benefit","Beneficiary Rules","Claim Process"],"facts":[{"name":"Group Coverage Provision","sentence":"Insurance company provides group coverage.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["group coverage","insurance provider","benefits eligibility"],"entities":[{"name":"Alliance Group Benefits","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"claims processing authority","relational_anchors":["Claims Department","1200 Insurance Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201","Claims Hotline: 1-888-555-CLAIM"]},{"name":"accelerated death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"benefit available under terminal diagnosis","relational_anchors":["up to 75%","minimum $5,000","maximum $250,000","actuarial discount applied"]},{"name":"12 months","type":"DATE","role":"time threshold for terminal illness eligibility","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$5,000","type":"FINANCIAL_VALUE","role":"minimum acceleration amount allowed","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$250,000","type":"FINANCIAL_VALUE","role":"maximum acceleration limit","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"1200 Insurance Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201","type":"LOCATION","role":"physical address for claims submission","relational_anchors":["Alliance Group Benefits - Claims Department"]},{"name":"1-888-555-CLAIM","type":"CONTACT_INFORMATION","role":"hotline for claim inquiries","relational_anchors":["Claims Hotline"]},{"name":"completed claim form","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"mandatory documentation for claim initiation","relational_anchors":["available from employer or insurer"]},{"name":"certified death certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"official proof of death required","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"proof of beneficiary identity","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"document verifying beneficiary status","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"suicide exclusion","type":"CONCEPT","role":"coverage limitation during first year","relational_anchors":["within 12 months of coverage effective date"]},{"name":"pre-existing condition limitation","type":"CONCEPT","role":"absence of restrictions in group coverage","relational_anchors":["None"]}]},{"name":"Portability Without Medical Exam","sentence":"Evidence of insurability is not required for portability.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["portability","evidence of insurability","coverage transfer"],"entities":[{"name":"Alliance Group Benefits","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"claims processing authority","relational_anchors":["Claims Department","1200 Insurance Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201","Claims Hotline: 1-888-555-CLAIM"]},{"name":"accelerated death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"benefit available under terminal diagnosis","relational_anchors":["up to 75%","minimum $5,000","maximum $250,000","actuarial discount applied"]},{"name":"12 months","type":"DATE","role":"time threshold for terminal illness eligibility","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$5,000","type":"FINANCIAL_VALUE","role":"minimum acceleration amount allowed","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$250,000","type":"FINANCIAL_VALUE","role":"maximum acceleration limit","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"1200 Insurance Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201","type":"LOCATION","role":"physical address for claims submission","relational_anchors":["Alliance Group Benefits - Claims Department"]},{"name":"1-888-555-CLAIM","type":"CONTACT_INFORMATION","role":"hotline for claim inquiries","relational_anchors":["Claims Hotline"]},{"name":"completed claim form","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"mandatory documentation for claim initiation","relational_anchors":["available from employer or insurer"]},{"name":"certified death certificate","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"official proof of death required","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"proof of beneficiary identity","type":"DOCUMENT","role":"document verifying beneficiary status","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"suicide exclusion","type":"CONCEPT","role":"coverage limitation during first year","relational_anchors":["within 12 months of coverage effective date"]},{"name":"pre-existing condition limitation","type":"CONCEPT","role":"absence of restrictions in group coverage","relational_anchors":["None"]}]},{"name":"Terminal Illness Qualification","sentence":"A terminal illness diagnosis with a life expectancy of 12 months or less qualifies for accelerated death benefit.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["accelerated death benefit","terminal illness","life expectancy"],"entities":[{"name":"Alliance Group Benefits","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"claims processing authority","relational_anchors":["Claims Department","1200 Insurance Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201","Claims Hotline: 1-888-555-CLAIM"]},{"name":"accelerated death benefit","type":"CONCEPT","role":"benefit available under terminal diagnosis","relational_anchors":["up to 75%","minimum $5,000","maximum $250,000","actuarial discount applied"]},{"name":"12 months","type":"DATE","role":"time threshold for terminal illness elig