    <node id="c74b4539-35e2-4536-b884-8e5f4958af99">
      <data key="d0">{"name":"Premium Waiver for Disability","text":" Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201\n     Claims Hotline: 1-888-555-CLAIM\n\n10.4 Benefits will be paid within 10 business days of receipt of \n     complete claim documentation.\n\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSECTION 11 - WAIVER OF PREMIUM\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n11.1 If you become totally disabled before age 60 and remain \n     disabled for 6 consecutive months, your voluntary life \n     insurance premiums will be waived.\n\n11.2 Coverage continues without premium payment during disability.\n\n11.3 You must provide proof of continuing disability annually.\n\n11.4 Waiver ends when you return to work, recover, or reach age 65.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nThis certificate is issued under and governed by the laws of the \nstate of California.\n\nALLIANCE GROUP BENEFITS\nDallas, Texas\n\n________________________________\nVice President, Group Operations\n\nIssued: June 1, 2024\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n","summary":"Benefits under this life insurance policy are payable within 10 business days of receiving complete claim documents. A premium waiver provision applies if an insured person becomes totally disabled before age 60 and remains disabled for six consecutive months, allowing coverage to continue without further premium payments. Proof of continued disability must be submitted annually, and the waiver ceases upon return to work, recovery, or attainment of age 65. This policy is issued under California state law.","topics":["Life Insurance","Premium Waiver","Disability Benefits","Claims Processing"],"facts":[{"name":"Plaza Location","sentence":"Plaza is located at Dallas, TX 75201.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Plaza address","Dallas location","contact information"],"entities":[{"name":"Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201","type":"LOCATION","role":"primary office address","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Claims Hotline: 1-888-555-CLAIM","type":"CONTACT_INFORMATION","role":"claim submission channel","relational_anchors":["1-888-555-CLAIM"]},{"name":"June 1, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"issuance date of certificate","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Benefits will be paid within 10 business days of receipt of complete claim documentation.","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payment timeline condition","relational_anchors":["10 business days"]},{"name":"Waiver of Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"premium relief provision","relational_anchors":["Section 11"]},{"name":"totally disabled before age 60 and remain disabled for 6 consecutive months","type":"CONDITION","role":"eligibility trigger for waiver","relational_anchors":["age 60","6 consecutive months"]},{"name":"Coverage continues without premium payment during disability","type":"STATUS","role":"coverage continuation rule","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"You must provide proof of continuing disability annually","type":"OBLIGATION","role":"proof requirement during waiver","relational_anchors":["annually"]},{"name":"Waiver ends when you return to work, recover, or reach age 65","type":"TERMINATION_CONDITION","role":"waiver termination criteria","relational_anchors":["return to work","recover","age 65"]},{"name":"ALLIANCE GROUP BENEFITS","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of benefits certificate","relational_anchors":["Dallas, Texas"]},{"name":"Vice President, Group Operations","type":"ROLE","role":"authorized signatory position","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"the laws of the state of California","type":"LEGAL_JURISDICTION","role":"governing law clause","relational_anchors":["California"]}]},{"name":"Claims Contact Information","sentence":"The claims hotline number is 1-888-555-CLAIM.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["claims hotline","contact details","claim submission"],"entities":[{"name":"Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201","type":"LOCATION","role":"primary office address","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Claims Hotline: 1-888-555-CLAIM","type":"CONTACT_INFORMATION","role":"claim submission channel","relational_anchors":["1-888-555-CLAIM"]},{"name":"June 1, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"issuance date of certificate","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Benefits will be paid within 10 business days of receipt of complete claim documentation.","type":"CONCEPT","role":"payment timeline condition","relational_anchors":["10 business days"]},{"name":"Waiver of Premium","type":"CONCEPT","role":"premium relief provision","relational_anchors":["Section 11"]},{"name":"totally disabled before age 60 and remain disabled for 6 consecutive months","type":"CONDITION","role":"eligibility trigger for waiver","relational_anchors":["age 60","6 consecutive months"]},{"name":"Coverage continues without premium payment during disability","type":"STATUS","role":"coverage continuation rule","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"You must provide proof of continuing disability annually","type":"OBLIGATION","role":"proof requirement during waiver","relational_anchors":["annually"]},{"name":"Waiver ends when you return to work, recover, or reach age 65","type":"TERMINATION_CONDITION","role":"waiver termination criteria","relational_anchors":["return to work","recover","age 65"]},{"name":"ALLIANCE GROUP BENEFITS","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuer of benefits certificate","relational_anchors":["Dallas, Texas"]},{"name":"Vice President, Group Operations","type":"ROLE","role":"authorized signatory position","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"the laws of the state of California","type":"LEGAL_JURISDICTION","role":"governing law clause","relational_anchors":["California"]}]},{"name":"Claim Payment Timeline","sentence":"Benefits will be paid within 10 business days of receipt of complete claim documentation.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["claim documentation","benefit disbursement","processing time"],"entities":[{"name":"Plaza, Dallas, TX 75201","type":"LOC