    <edge source="b8006244-ba88-4c0f-b1d8-4d8125ad2697" target="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77">
      <data key="d3">The effective date of coverage on June 1, 2024, marks the beginning of eligibility for potential premium waiver due to disability, requiring annual proof thereafter to maintain waived premiums.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
