    <edge source="b8006244-ba88-4c0f-b1d8-4d8125ad2697" target="2a19b2b9-fddd-401f-bef2-b20573f7051a">
      <data key="d3">The effective date of coverage on June 1, 2024, sets the timeline from which the six-month continuous disability requirement for premium waiver begins. Without knowing when coverage starts, it would not be possible to determine whether the disability period meets the required duration.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
