      <data key="d3">The effective date of coverage on June 1, 2024, sets the timeline for when the premium waiver provision can apply; its activation hinges on disability occurring after this date. The waiver's end condition—return to work—is logically dependent on the initial coverage period established here.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
