      <data key="d3">The employer's payment of premiums for basic coverage operates under the broader contractual framework defined by the certificate’s terms, conditions, and exclusions.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
