      <data key="d3">Jordan Casey Taylor is named as the primary beneficiary, meaning they are entitled to receive benefits if the insured passes away after the policy’s effective date of June 1, 2024.</data>
      <data key="d4">applies to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
