      <data key="d3">Jordan Casey Taylor is named as the primary beneficiary; this role is substantiated by their status as the insured’s spouse, establishing eligibility based on marital relationship.</data>
      <data key="d4">spouse of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="2c03a154-97c0-4d73-ad37-1599582fab56" target="b9fb6a96-3110-4371-bdfa-b3a62b485271">
      <data key="d3">Jordan Casey Taylor is named as the primary beneficiary; consequently, they receive the full benefit payout upon claim.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
