      <data key="d3">The Master Group Policy being issued to the employer sets the contractual foundation for the insurance arrangement. As such, all aspects of individual coverage—including benefits, eligibility, and limitations—are defined by the terms outlined within this master agreement.</data>
      <data key="d4">derives from</data>
