      <data key="d3">The policy being issued to the employer establishes the legal and administrative foundation for the group insurance program. This foundational status enables the implementation of eligibility rules such as those beginning at hire.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
