      <data key="d3">The Master Group Policy being issued to the employer establishes the legal framework under which benefits are administered. This enables basic coverage to become effective automatically when employees meet eligibility criteria.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
