      <data key="d3">The master policy being issued to the employer sets the administrative framework under which benefits are managed. This structural detail supports the implementation of basic coverage without requiring evidence of insurability, enabling immediate access upon eligibility.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
