      <data key="d3">The master policy being issued to the employer sets up the administrative framework under which benefits are managed. This foundational arrangement enables the implementation of enrollment rules like those requiring timely sign-up for voluntary coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
