      <data key="d3">The master policy being issued to the employer sets up the administrative foundation for the plan, enabling provisions like voluntary supplemental coverage elections. This structural setup allows employees to choose incremental increases in coverage under defined terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
