    <edge source="693c8b53-e227-49d5-956d-bb6f61b86d8b" target="ffc538ab-5ff6-4960-b2c1-1eef9713da66">
      <data key="d3">Basic coverage activates automatically when an employee meets eligibility criteria, and its value is determined by multiplying the employee's annual base salary by two.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
