      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="693c8b53-e227-49d5-956d-bb6f61b86d8b" target="cee100a2-2052-41c7-9f66-4edb378b821d">
      <data key="d3">Basic coverage begins automatically once eligible, setting the baseline condition. However, if enrollment happens over 31 days after hire, special late entrant rules take effect instead of standard procedures.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional dependency</data>
