      <data key="d3">Basic coverage activates automatically at eligibility, and once active, its benefit amount is adjusted annually based on policy terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="693c8b53-e227-49d5-956d-bb6f61b86d8b" target="ebda2a4b-af98-4477-809f-34d2ba734e4c">
      <data key="d3">Basic coverage begins automatically when an employee meets eligibility requirements, and its monetary value may later be adjusted based on changes in the employee's salary.</data>
