    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="a2314015-ba2f-446d-8508-e444ccc759b1">
      <data key="d3">Since no evidence of insurability was required for basic coverage, it could be activated quickly, forming part of the $280,000 total benefit amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">part of</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="b8006244-ba88-4c0f-b1d8-4d8125ad2697">
      <data key="d3">Since no evidence of insurability was required, the basic coverage could be activated on June 1, 2024, ensuring immediate implementation from the start date.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="c640c250-030a-4238-b2c4-ee2b7b8201bf">
      <data key="d3">Since no evidence of insurability is needed, the employer can fund basic coverage directly without requiring health assessments.</data>
      <data key="d4">necessitates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="bb3b7a5f-abd9-466a-a39b-019177c58922">
      <data key="d3">Since no evidence of insurability was required, the issuance of the certificate as official proof of coverage becomes straightforward and immediate upon enrollment, validating its role as authoritative documentation.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="f2fe91f4-2acc-437e-b04b-0b025b2ef31c">
      <data key="d3">The absence of an insurability requirement for basic coverage allows swift activation of benefits once enrolled. This condition operates within the broader system where the employer holds the master policy, ensuring seamless administration.</data>
      <data key="d4">enabled by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="70945007-c2b7-452b-9909-9a125e9b73e5">
      <data key="d3">Since no evidence of insurability was required for basic coverage, this implies such a term is explicitly permitted or mandated by the broader Master Policy governing the plan.</data>
      <data key="d4">implied by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.92</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="1976d0c5-bd83-492b-af9c-24b53a14f5dc">
      <data key="d3">The lack of need for evidence of insurability reflects a term explicitly included within the policy's governing conditions.</data>
      <data key="d4">implied by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="5cd717d1-9c10-4167-8667-538fce460dac">
      <data key="d3">Since no evidence of insurability was needed, basic coverage took effect promptly from the moment eligibility began at hire.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="693c8b53-e227-49d5-956d-bb6f61b86d8b">
      <data key="d3">The absence of any need for evidence of insurability enables basic coverage to take effect automatically upon eligibility.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="cee100a2-2052-41c7-9f66-4edb378b821d">
      <data key="d3">The absence of insurability requirements ensures immediate eligibility for basic coverage regardless of health status, though delayed enrollment beyond 31 days triggers additional administrative provisions.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f16ac29d-6ba1-46fc-9730-c308445ea0c2" target="ffc538ab-5ff6-4960-b2c1-1eef9713da66">
      <data key="d3">Basic coverage becomes effective without requiring proof of health, ensuring immediate access for eligible employees. This automatic approval enables the application of a standardized formula based on salary to determine the exact benefit amount.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables calculation</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
