    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="a2314015-ba2f-446d-8508-e444ccc759b1">
      <data key="d3">To achieve the full $280,000 coverage, employees must enroll in the voluntary $100,000 supplement within 31 days of hiring; otherwise, they would miss out on this portion of the total benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="9fa5fe2f-bcde-4972-ab81-4ae967ccf64b">
      <data key="d3">Employees must enroll within 31 days of hire to qualify for the $100,000 voluntary coverage option.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="704873e4-f362-4a71-8e40-cfdd3ea1f5e2">
      <data key="d3">To legally secure the elective voluntary coverage, the employee had to enroll within 31 days of hire, meaning the timing constraint directly enables or validates the election described in the first sentence.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="b8006244-ba88-4c0f-b1d8-4d8125ad2697">
      <data key="d3">To qualify for coverage beginning June 1, 2024, employees were required to complete enrollment in voluntary coverage within 31 days of being hired.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="c0378a0c-15e9-46db-80c6-212e4003560d">
      <data key="d3">Meeting the 31-day enrollment window after hire is necessary before the employee becomes responsible for the $12 monthly premium.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="bb3b7a5f-abd9-466a-a39b-019177c58922">
      <data key="d3">Timely enrollment in voluntary coverage within 31 days of hire ensures continued eligibility for additional benefits. The certificate acts as verification that such coverage has been formally established.</data>
      <data key="d4">verified by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="f2fe91f4-2acc-437e-b04b-0b025b2ef31c">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to enroll in voluntary coverage within 31 days of hire depends on the existence of a formalized group policy issued to the employer, which establishes the basis for such enrollment procedures.</data>
      <data key="d4">required by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="70945007-c2b7-452b-9909-9a125e9b73e5">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to enroll in voluntary coverage within 31 days of hire is enforced through the terms outlined in the Master Policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">enforced by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="1976d0c5-bd83-492b-af9c-24b53a14f5dc">
      <data key="d3">The mandatory 31-day enrollment period for voluntary coverage implies that such requirements are part of the official terms and conditions stated in the certificate, making it a concrete example of how the general rules apply operationally.</data>
      <data key="d4">implied by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="5cd717d1-9c10-4167-8667-538fce460dac">
      <data key="d3">Employees must enroll in voluntary coverage within 31 days of hire, meaning eligibility directly triggers the enrollment window.</data>
      <data key="d4">follows</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="cee100a2-2052-41c7-9f66-4edb378b821d">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to enroll within 31 days of hire sets a clear timeline; if missed, employees trigger late entrant provisions, meaning they may face different terms or restrictions.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="f15e476d-3d7a-4b13-809d-10b26b7c85b3" target="c5f8925f-a280-4bc9-8813-a9b5d6d07c07">
      <data key="d3">The deadline for enrolling in voluntary coverage ensures employees act promptly, but the maximum allowable amount they can elect depends on their salary, limiting how much they can choose even if enrolled early.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
