    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="3721319d-49fa-40bf-858f-e5fff2b66d74">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to recalculate benefits annually ensures ongoing alignment with employee salaries, but this adjustment is bounded by the fixed $1 million maximum coverage limit.</data>
      <data key="d4">bound by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="9690cd42-7774-4809-a8ce-a06325472dfc">
      <data key="d3">Since the basic benefit is recalculated annually, it incorporates any changes to the employee’s current salary, ensuring the maximum elective coverage remains aligned with the five-times-salary rule.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74">
      <data key="d3">The annual recalculation of the basic benefit depends on updated salary information, ensuring the benefit amount reflects the employee’s current earnings at each policy anniversary.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="61937f46-373a-4006-9ace-d654c1af6a04">
      <data key="d3">The annual recalculation of basic benefits determines the current coverage level, which influences the maximum amount available for conversion into an individual policy when group coverage ends.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="cb39d508-63bc-4d1f-b31d-8e17c8da36fc">
      <data key="d3">Annual recalculation of benefits determines the amount eligible for conversion; therefore, the converted policy reflects the most recent benefit level established through this process.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="a9f431d0-a3a3-4a6f-a8b7-104c24124f59">
      <data key="d3">The annual recalculation of basic benefits ensures current coverage aligns with salary changes during employment. This dynamic adjustment creates the basis for determining the amount eligible for porting when employment ends.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="84ecaece-d3be-49c1-95f0-cc92e7c46732">
      <data key="d3">The annual recalculation of the basic benefit determines the original group coverage amount used to set the conversion limit. This ensures that the maximum convertible benefit reflects the most recent covered salary.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="e354fe16-ca2b-40c3-a6a8-b4f688cd15e9">
      <data key="d3">The annual recalculation of the basic benefit determines the exact coverage amount that becomes eligible for porting into an individual policy after job separation.</data>
      <data key="d4">determines</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="d986ae35-896f-42e2-ade3-c28663178d9d">
      <data key="d3">The annual recalculation of the basic benefit determines the coverage amount available upon termination, influencing the potential scope of ported coverage. This affects the basis for applying age-banded group rates when converting to an individual policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34" target="03d8ddf1-d4d8-4fbc-aa24-7b7db121df87">
      <data key="d3">The annual recalculation of basic benefits ensures that coverage remains aligned with current salaries, maintaining financial relevance throughout employment. This periodic adjustment supports the stability of future conversion rights, including portability, by preserving baseline coverage levels at termination.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
