    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="3721319d-49fa-40bf-858f-e5fff2b66d74">
      <data key="d3">Salary-driven recalculations determine the actual coverage amount, which must not surpass the $1 million threshold established in the first statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">constrained by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="9690cd42-7774-4809-a8ce-a06325472dfc">
      <data key="d3">Annual recalculations use the employee’s current salary to determine eligible coverage limits, thereby enforcing the five-times-salary cap consistently over time.</data>
      <data key="d4">derives from</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="ea3ec25d-9582-4df4-a238-3ee4af975a34">
      <data key="d3">Since the benefit is adjusted yearly, it requires up-to-date salary figures; thus, the recalculations are contingent upon the most recent salary data available.</data>
      <data key="d4">modifies</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf">
      <data key="d3">The annual recalculation of benefits based on current salary determines the maximum coverage available upon termination, which informs the potential conversion limit. This context makes timely submission of a conversion application critical.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="cb39d508-63bc-4d1f-b31d-8e17c8da36fc">
      <data key="d3">The employee’s current salary determines the level of coverage eligible for conversion into an individual policy, which is then issued based on their attained age at the time of conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="a9f431d0-a3a3-4a6f-a8b7-104c24124f59">
      <data key="d3">The annual adjustment of benefits based on current salary determines the level of coverage eligible for conversion or porting upon leaving employment.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="84ecaece-d3be-49c1-95f0-cc92e7c46732">
      <data key="d3">The employee's current salary determines the level of group coverage, which directly influences the maximum amount eligible for conversion into an individual policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="e354fe16-ca2b-40c3-a6a8-b4f688cd15e9">
      <data key="d3">The group policy's benefit amount is determined by the employee’s current salary through annual recalculation, ensuring accurate reflection of compensation. When converting or porting coverage, the resulting individual policy mirrors this recalculated amount exactly.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="d986ae35-896f-42e2-ade3-c28663178d9d">
      <data key="d3">The annual adjustment of benefits based on current salary influences the maximum amount eligible for conversion or porting, indirectly shaping the scope of coverage available when transitioning to an individual policy. This sets the stage for determining applicable premium tiers upon conversion.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="a2314015-ba2f-446d-8508-e444ccc759b1">
      <data key="d3">The fixed coverage figure of $280,000 depends on periodic reassessment linked to salary, meaning it is not static and subject to revision per the process described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="9fa5fe2f-bcde-4972-ab81-4ae967ccf64b">
      <data key="d3">The requirement that coverage be recalculated annually based on salary, mentioned in fact_sentence_2, implies that the previously set $100,000 voluntary coverage level could increase or decrease depending on salary changes, affecting its long-term stability.</data>
      <data key="d4">influences</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74" target="b8006244-ba88-4c0f-b1d8-4d8125ad2697">
      <data key="d3">Salary-driven recalculations inform ongoing coverage amounts beginning from the initial effective date of June 1, 2024, maintaining alignment with the original coverage commencement timeline.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
