    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="9690cd42-7774-4809-a8ce-a06325472dfc">
      <data key="d3">To exercise the option of converting coverage, employees must apply within 31 days of losing group coverage, ensuring timely action before eligibility expires.</data>
      <data key="d4">timing of action</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="832e18bd-3db9-4b0d-a12a-09f2d351cc74">
      <data key="d3">Submitting a conversion application within 31 days ensures access to favorable terms, including no medical exam, contingent on the previously determined benefit level derived from current salary.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="87cd45fe-5845-4daf-8291-66684bb077e9">
      <data key="d3">The need to apply for conversion within 31 days arises directly from the termination of group coverage, which is governed by specific exit criteria outlined earlier.</data>
      <data key="d4">required after</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="61937f46-373a-4006-9ace-d654c1af6a04">
      <data key="d3">The deadline to apply for conversion—to ensure access to the option—is strictly limited to 31 days post-termination, but only applies when the termination isn't due to non-payment of premium.</data>
      <data key="d4">temporal dependency</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="2a484835-c2d5-4916-aaf4-80a161c5cdca">
      <data key="d3">Even though no evidence of insurability is needed, applicants must act quickly—within 31 days—to preserve their right to convert, highlighting urgency over qualification barriers.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="cb39d508-63bc-4d1f-b31d-8e17c8da36fc">
      <data key="d3">A conversion application must be filed within 31 days after losing group coverage; otherwise, the right to convert expires. At the time of filing, the new policy is issued using the employee’s current (attained) age.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="aa55d164-41ad-4557-9ee0-9d585db80f12">
      <data key="d3">If an employee submits a conversion application within 31 days of losing group coverage, they become eligible for an individual policy subject to standard premium rates.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="84ecaece-d3be-49c1-95f0-cc92e7c46732">
      <data key="d3">If an employee submits a conversion application within 31 days of termination, they become eligible for a new policy with a maximum benefit limited by either their prior group coverage or $200,000.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="4ec56b43-419b-48f6-9329-06f8c3d46b41">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to apply within 31 days ensures participants act promptly, enabling them to access conversion options like the one described in fact_sentence_2, which waives the need for a medical exam.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="a9f431d0-a3a3-4a6f-a8b7-104c24124f59">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to apply within 31 days ensures timely access to conversion options upon leaving employment, enabling individuals to secure continued coverage through an individual policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="e354fe16-ca2b-40c3-a6a8-b4f688cd15e9">
      <data key="d3">The deadline for applying to convert coverage ensures participants retain access to their previous benefit amount when transitioning to an individual policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="d986ae35-896f-42e2-ade3-c28663178d9d">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to apply within 31 days ensures access to ported coverage at favorable terms, including age-banded group rates, which are available only during this period.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="03d8ddf1-d4d8-4fbc-aa24-7b7db121df87">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to apply within 31 days enables individuals to act quickly when transitioning from group to individual coverage, especially since no medical evidence is needed—a key enabler for prompt portability.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="a53bb99a-3253-4bd8-9b0c-bc4334f7b67d">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 outlines the requirement to apply for conversion within 31 days of losing group coverage, which typically follows employment cessation. Fact_sentence_2 establishes that portability applications must also be made within 31 days of job termination, ensuring timely access to alternative coverage options post-employment.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="a4f89de4-1afc-4c97-948f-48c37a6cfc59">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to apply within 31 days aligns with the ease of portability, which does not demand proof of health, allowing swift transition from group to individual coverage post-employment loss.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="c3c8847b-85e9-4a8d-9b64-6b4b5efd5144">
      <data key="d3">The ability to convert group coverage within 31 days of leaving employment enables participants to secure permanent protection, which could later allow them to access accelerated benefits if diagnosed terminally ill, thereby reducing the eventual death benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf" target="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to apply for conversion within 31 days ensures ongoing coverage, which enables beneficiaries to file claims later under the converted individual policy. Without timely conversion, the right to claim benefits through the new policy would be lost.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="b8f96389-0fce-4dfd-b2ea-66ee2bdfc5ec" target="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">triggers conversion deadline</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="336ceb15-ca20-44d7-a0f3-3beec74849fa" target="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">defines the start date for</data>
    </edge>
