      <data key="d3">Ported coverage relies on age-banded group rates, which are possible due to the waived requirement for evidence of insurability, simplifying the transition process.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="d986ae35-896f-42e2-ade3-c28663178d9d" target="a2314015-ba2f-446d-8508-e444ccc759b1">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2's mention of age-banded group rates for ported coverage implies these rates would apply to the $280,000 coverage level referenced in fact_sentence_1 during conversion.</data>
