    <edge source="9eb92b90-d878-4770-ab6d-789054602190" target="87cd45fe-5845-4daf-8291-66684bb077e9">
      <data key="d3">The requirement to pay premiums directly to the insurance company applies specifically after coverage has ended due to termination events like leaving employment, making it contingent upon the conditions outlined in the prior statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
