      <data key="d3">Direct payment of premiums to the insurer applies specifically to individuals who have converted from group to individual coverage, typically upon leaving employment.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9eb92b90-d878-4770-ab6d-789054602190" target="4ec56b43-419b-48f6-9329-06f8c3d46b41">
      <data key="d3">Premiums for ported coverage are paid directly to the insurer, reflecting active management by the participant. This requirement complements the absence of a medical exam during conversion, allowing seamless continuation without health-based barriers.</data>
      <data key="d4">complies with</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
