      <data key="d3">Payment of premiums directly to the insurance company only applies once an individual successfully applies for portability within the specified window after leaving employment.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9eb92b90-d878-4770-ab6d-789054602190" target="d986ae35-896f-42e2-ade3-c28663178d9d">
      <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 indicates that premiums for ported coverage are paid directly to the insurer, ensuring proper handling of funds. This aligns with the rate structure described in fact sentence 1, which sets the amount due based on age bands.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
