    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="2cbd5814-f54a-4af1-92c0-18cfd941020d">
      <data key="d3">Immediate notification to Alliance Group Benefits ensures timely claim initiation, relying on the prior establishment of the insurance company as the administrator of the policy.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="d03f6263-7bbe-40c1-89fa-5e693533134a">
      <data key="d3">Promptly informing Alliance Group Benefits after the insured’s death enables faster initiation of the claims process. Since the earliest possible payout begins once documentation starts being processed, timely notice supports quicker access to the minimum $5,000 acceleration.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="800afedf-6828-402d-ac61-26fa74c9cb5b">
      <data key="d3">Immediate notification of the insurer ensures timely initiation of the claims procedure, enabling the possibility of accessing up to $250,000 in accelerated benefits under the policy terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="f148ea16-1810-4ee0-8bd3-fc0b480c1222">
      <data key="d3">Immediate notification of the insured's death initiates the claims process, leading to potential disbursement of benefits subject to actuarial adjustments like those described in the prior statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="c3c8847b-85e9-4a8d-9b64-6b4b5efd5144">
      <data key="d3">Promptly informing Alliance Group Benefits ensures the claim process begins, allowing for possible early distribution of funds under the policy’s acceleration terms, thereby affecting how much remains for final beneficiaries.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="80ef03d9-a0d8-4e34-b854-917b328e532c">
      <data key="d3">Notifying the insurer promptly ensures that the process leading to potential estate disbursement can begin without delay, supporting efficient claims resolution.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="6158d9a5-ff94-4835-99aa-58729bb45911">
      <data key="d3">Promptly notifying Alliance Group Benefits initiates the claims procedure, enabling the company to verify beneficiary details and proceed with distributing funds per the agreed allocation, such as equal shares when multiple beneficiaries are listed.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="fabc920e-4e63-48bd-8ae0-5520935f9ace">
      <data key="d3">Notifying Alliance Group Benefits upon the insured’s death sets off the formal claims procedure, during which submitting a completed claim form becomes necessary.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="6a34626d-60fc-44c8-a650-49df4e862518">
      <data key="d3">Notifying Alliance Group Benefits triggers the claims process, making it necessary to submit required documentation such as a certified death certificate.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="4a5e1799-2abe-49d2-a8ee-2933001fa99f">
      <data key="d3">Notifying Alliance Group Benefits promptly ensures timely initiation of the claims process, enabling the subsequent submission of required documents to the Claims Department without delay.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="ba0648f1-21c7-41d2-baec-33f72f4b198e">
      <data key="d3">Notifying Alliance Group Benefits promptly begins the claims process, leading directly to the requirement for verifying the beneficiary’s identity to ensure proper distribution of funds.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="48d672b8-4057-4fee-8100-1e2361e1ca93">
      <data key="d3">Beneficiaries must promptly inform Alliance Group Benefits after the insured’s death, and the claims hotline serves as the primary means to initiate the process.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f">
      <data key="d3">Notifying Alliance Group Benefits promptly initiates the claims process, ensuring timely handling. Access to the claim form through the employer or insurer supports the next steps required by the beneficiary.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="a4660611-ebc8-4a98-ae71-7b04c1befa54">
      <data key="d3">Notifying Alliance Group Benefits promptly ensures timely initiation of the claims process, enabling beneficiaries to proceed with sending required documentation to the designated address for processing.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f" target="22c4b994-6a5b-49d5-a129-731be848f272">
      <data key="d3">Notifying Alliance Group Benefits immediately initiates the claims workflow, ensuring that required documents are processed without delay, thereby enabling benefits to be issued within the stated 10-business-day window once all materials are received.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
