    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="2cbd5814-f54a-4af1-92c0-18cfd941020d">
      <data key="d3">The presence of a claim form available from the insurer implies that the insurer manages the benefits process, supporting its role in delivering group coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="89ba6d0e-f1eb-478c-935c-effa8d9500ab">
      <data key="d3">The claim form used for requesting an accelerated death benefit due to terminal illness can be obtained from the employer or the insurer. This step supports the process initiated by qualifying under specific medical conditions like a life expectancy of 12 months or less.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="ad33389a-5e72-4baf-8990-51a347fe4a8a">
      <data key="d3">To accelerate up to 75% of the death benefit upon a terminal diagnosis, one must submit a claim form, which is obtainable from the employer or the insurer, ensuring timely processing of the request.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="d03f6263-7bbe-40c1-89fa-5e693533134a">
      <data key="d3">Access to the claim form through the employer or insurer enables applicants to begin the process of accelerating benefits. Since the minimum allowable acceleration is $5,000, only those seeking at least this amount would need to complete such forms.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="800afedf-6828-402d-ac61-26fa74c9cb5b">
      <data key="d3">Knowing where to get the claim form enables action toward accessing benefits, including those up to the stated maximum of $250,000.</data>
      <data key="d4">informational support</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="c3c8847b-85e9-4a8d-9b64-6b4b5efd5144">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 states that the claim form can be obtained from the employer or insurer, enabling policyholders to begin the claims process. This step precedes any decision to accelerate benefits, making it foundational to actions like those described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="80ef03d9-a0d8-4e34-b854-917b328e532c">
      <data key="d3">The claim form, accessible through the employer or insurer, is a prerequisite for initiating a claim. Without it, beneficiaries cannot proceed with claiming benefits—even if they are designated or if the estate is entitled under policy rules.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="afec02f1-3018-4d35-a72f-90bd5e82289f">
      <data key="d3">Having the claim form readily accessible enables beneficiaries to begin the claims process quickly. This readiness facilitates immediate notification to Alliance Group Benefits once the insured’s passing is confirmed.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="fabc920e-4e63-48bd-8ae0-5520935f9ace">
      <data key="d3">Access to the claim form via employer or insurer enables policyholders to fulfill the prerequisite of submitting a completed form for claims processing.</data>
      <data key="d4">required for</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="ba0648f1-21c7-41d2-baec-33f72f4b198e">
      <data key="d3">The claim form, accessible through the employer or insurer, is necessary to begin the claims process, which requires subsequent submission of proof of beneficiary identity.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="6a34626d-60fc-44c8-a650-49df4e862518">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 provides information about accessing the claim form, which is a prerequisite step before submitting other required documents like the certified death certificate.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="4a5e1799-2abe-49d2-a8ee-2933001fa99f">
      <data key="d3">The availability of the claim form through the employer or insurer enables timely initiation of the claims process, which culminates in its required submission to the designated claims department.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="a4660611-ebc8-4a98-ae71-7b04c1befa54">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 indicates the source for obtaining the claim form, which is a prerequisite step before sending documents. This enables the next action described in fact_sentence_2—the physical submission of the completed form to the designated address.</data>
      <data key="d4">precedes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="48d672b8-4057-4fee-8100-1e2361e1ca93">
      <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 explains how to obtain the claim form, and fact_sentence_2 offers a phone number to call for help with claims, providing additional access points for claim-related inquiries.</data>
      <data key="d4">supplements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="30ed27ef-e97f-4082-96c0-a90281492f8f" target="22c4b994-6a5b-49d5-a129-731be848f272">
      <data key="d3">Having access to the claim form through the employer or insurer ensures applicants can initiate the claims process promptly, facilitating the insurer’s ability to pay benefits within ten business days upon receipt of a complete application.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
