    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="f34fa4fc-cd2a-4dd2-9c87-90ec079d2207">
      <data key="d3">Knowing that benefits are paid within 10 business days encourages claimants to use the hotline to ensure timely submission of documents, aligning with the policy’s efficiency expectations.</data>
      <data key="d4">incentivizes</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="2a19b2b9-fddd-401f-bef2-b20573f7051a">
      <data key="d3">The prompt for benefit payment within 10 business days depends on having complete documentation; however, the qualification for a premium waiver hinges on meeting specific disability criteria, including a six-month continuous period of total disability.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional dependency</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="c4725b84-8de5-4ef8-a696-eca5ff0b4577">
      <data key="d3">The prompt to pay benefits within 10 business days assumes the existence of qualifying events such as prolonged disability, which allows coverage to remain active without premium payments.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77">
      <data key="d3">The prompt to submit proof of continuing disability ensures eligibility for the premium waiver, which maintains coverage so benefits remain available should a claim arise later.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="b8006244-ba88-4c0f-b1d8-4d8125ad2697">
      <data key="d3">The promise of timely benefit disbursement—within 10 business days of full documentation—is meaningful only once coverage has officially begun, reinforcing that the June 1, 2024, effective date marks the earliest possible trigger point for such payouts.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="c0378a0c-15e9-46db-80c6-212e4003560d">
      <data key="d3">The prompt payment of benefits within 10 business days relies on the existence of active coverage, which includes the voluntary component funded by the employee’s $12 monthly payment.</data>
      <data key="d4">enabled by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="2c03a154-97c0-4d73-ad37-1599582fab56">
      <data key="d3">The promise to pay benefits within 10 business days of receiving full claim documentation ensures timely disbursement to the designated primary beneficiary, Jordan Casey Taylor.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="c2b096bf-e2af-46ce-9492-7da5270a16a1">
      <data key="d3">The 10-business-day claims processing timeframe ensures timely delivery of benefits to the named beneficiary, Jordan Casey Taylor, whose status as spouse was established in the prior statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">informs</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.9</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="b9fb6a96-3110-4371-bdfa-b3a62b485271">
      <data key="d3">Timely processing of claims within 10 business days enables prompt delivery of the full benefit amount to the designated primary beneficiary, fulfilling the payout obligation established in the first fact.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="52b0c634-376a-4bbe-a0e1-f374e691f95a">
      <data key="d3">The promise that benefits will be paid within 10 business days of receiving full documentation supports timely distribution to the named contingent beneficiary, reinforcing the operational flow from claim submission to payment.</data>
      <data key="d4">timing support</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="0fd4ce41-df87-49ef-b846-edcb6c8e3ffc">
      <data key="d3">Timely payment of benefits within 10 business days depends on proper identification and validation of the rightful recipient, such as the contingent beneficiary specified in the first statement.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="8eab46db-8762-4987-ab49-5c7a33da05bf">
      <data key="d3">Timely submission of a conversion application preserves access to guaranteed-insurance options, ensuring that death benefits remain available when needed—even though the original group coverage has ended.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86" target="a53bb99a-3253-4bd8-9b0c-bc4334f7b67d">
      <data key="d3">While the 10-business-day claim processing rule determines when benefits are disbursed, its effectiveness depends on whether the beneficiary has successfully converted or ported coverage by the 31-day deadline, ensuring ongoing eligibility.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="9d824d29-c39e-4cc8-9dd6-84191b8f9cb0" target="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">payment timeline</data>
    </edge>
