    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="0fb61d44-5bc9-4a23-945d-cec5a551fb86">
      <data key="d3">Submitting annual proof of disability sustains the premium waiver status, enabling continuous coverage and ensuring that future benefit payouts are possible under the policy terms.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="be20ea5b-1e30-4df6-875f-f118a70b2164">
      <data key="d3">Annual proof of disability is necessary to sustain the Waiver of Premium benefit outlined in Section 11, ensuring continuous coverage without payment of premiums while disabled.</data>
      <data key="d4">sustains</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="eaa5dac8-c5eb-44c8-ba4e-507da4e5bf47">
      <data key="d3">Annual submission of proof of disability ensures that the premium waiver eligibility established by pre-age-60 total disability continues uninterrupted.</data>
      <data key="d4">sustains</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="2a19b2b9-fddd-401f-bef2-b20573f7051a">
      <data key="d3">Annual submission of proof of disability supports the continuation of the premium waiver, but such proof is only required after meeting the initial six-month disability criterion.</data>
      <data key="d4">depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="c4725b84-8de5-4ef8-a696-eca5ff0b4577">
      <data key="d3">Annual submission of proof of continued disability ensures eligibility for the premium waiver, enabling uninterrupted coverage despite inability to pay premiums.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables benefit</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="23b0d891-5c67-4e52-8ec2-f5323703371b">
      <data key="d3">Annual submission of proof ensures the insurer verifies ongoing eligibility for the premium waiver; failure to provide it could result in termination, especially if the individual returns to work.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172">
      <data key="d3">Annual submission of proof of disability is required only while the individual remains disabled. If they recover, the waiver ends, making continued documentation unnecessary.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional depends on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d">
      <data key="d3">Annual proof of disability maintains eligibility for the premium waiver, which continues until age 65, thereby linking document requirements directly to the termination condition.</data>
      <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="b8006244-ba88-4c0f-b1d8-4d8125ad2697">
      <data key="d3">Annual submission of disability proof supports the continuity of premium waiver benefits, which depend on coverage being actively in force since its effective date of June 1, 2024.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="c0378a0c-15e9-46db-80c6-212e4003560d">
      <data key="d3">Annual proof of disability is required to maintain a premium waiver, which would eliminate the need for the employee to pay the $12 monthly fee for voluntary coverage.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="2c03a154-97c0-4d73-ad37-1599582fab56">
      <data key="d3">Annual proof of disability ensures continuation of coverage via premium waiver, potentially affecting whether the named beneficiary, Jordan Casey Taylor, ultimately receives benefits based on the timing of the insured's death relative to disability duration.</data>
      <data key="d4">related to</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77" target="b9fb6a96-3110-4371-bdfa-b3a62b485271">
      <data key="d3">Annual submission of disability proof ensures continuous coverage via premium waiver, preserving the condition under which the primary beneficiary can receive the full benefit payout.</data>
      <data key="d4">enables</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.75</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="e0ec69c5-0f1f-4c0a-8737-c00c27357a65" target="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77">
