    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="9e820945-f7c7-45f7-9f1a-2390aa5b728e">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">role</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="ea762e17-873a-41dd-ab29-37b573c7f6ea">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">legal jurisdiction</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="be20ea5b-1e30-4df6-875f-f118a70b2164">
      <data key="d3">The end of the premium waiver upon recovery from disability implies that the provision exists to support individuals during prolonged disability, consistent with its inclusion in Section 11.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="eaa5dac8-c5eb-44c8-ba4e-507da4e5bf47">
      <data key="d3">Recovery from disability ends the premium waiver because the initial condition required for the waiver—ongoing total disability—is no longer met.</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="2a19b2b9-fddd-401f-bef2-b20573f7051a">
      <data key="d3">Recovery from disability triggers the end of the premium waiver. To have qualified initially, the disability must have lasted six consecutive months.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="c4725b84-8de5-4ef8-a696-eca5ff0b4577">
      <data key="d3">The end of the premium waiver occurs upon recovery from disability, meaning that prior continuation of coverage without premium payment depends on sustained disability status.</data>
      <data key="d4">caused by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77">
      <data key="d3">The end of the premium waiver due to recovery means the requirement to submit proof of disability also ceases, as the condition enabling the waiver no longer exists.</data>
      <data key="d4">causes termination</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="23b0d891-5c67-4e52-8ec2-f5323703371b">
      <data key="d3">Recovery from disability inherently means the individual is able to resume employment, so the end of the waiver due to recovery naturally includes cases where the person returns to work.</data>
      <data key="d4">implied by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d">
      <data key="d3">The end of the premium waiver due to recovery from disability does not depend on reaching age 65, though either condition alone terminates the waiver. Both serve as independent reasons for discontinuation.</data>
      <data key="d4">independent termination</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172" target="b8006244-ba88-4c0f-b1d8-4d8125ad2697">
      <data key="d3">While the coverage's effective date marks when protection begins, the waiver of premiums only applies after a qualifying disability event that occurs during the covered period, making it dependent on events occurring after June 1, 2024.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="49d5b195-03cf-4347-b66a-2db9d3aaed61" target="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates on recovery from disability</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="15232809-b6be-4d22-a64d-11dd5e9cf11c" target="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">triggers termination of premium waiver</data>
    </edge>
