      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">concept</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="c3eebb37-6b5b-4633-84c2-9caeefd8bac7">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">condition</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="333715c4-fae2-4929-83a6-6456394f2081">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">status</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="d401d7cf-64f5-4b52-8b7a-6bdfdf5f9447">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">obligation</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="1fb591a0-9a7e-433b-a2e7-07dfa474c148">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">termination condition</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="44ab8c9e-d378-4bb6-bcb7-c9fe713c7f27">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">organization</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="fc2ffe96-c731-4c03-a827-52c4410218c1">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">role</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="7c1ce940-f326-4241-b95e-6fee1111703b">
      <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
      <data key="d4">legal jurisdiction</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="be20ea5b-1e30-4df6-875f-f118a70b2164">
      <data key="d3">The end date of the premium waiver at age 65 is part of the broader provisions detailed in Section 11, which governs the waiver's conditions and duration.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditions</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="eaa5dac8-c5eb-44c8-ba4e-507da4e5bf47">
      <data key="d3">The end of the premium waiver at age 65 follows from its initial activation due to total disability prior to age 60, establishing a temporal boundary for the benefit.</data>
      <data key="d4">terminates</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="2a19b2b9-fddd-401f-bef2-b20573f7051a">
      <data key="d3">Although the premium waiver may begin after six consecutive months of total disability, it cannot extend beyond age 65, thus imposing a hard cap on how long the benefit can remain active even if disability persists.</data>
      <data key="d4">limited by</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="c4725b84-8de5-4ef8-a696-eca5ff0b4577">
      <data key="d3">Since the waiver ends at age 65, coverage may require resumed premium payments after that point unless another condition maintains the waiver.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="a70714ad-8510-4e0d-a516-a0551aa2fc77">
      <data key="d3">The end date of the premium waiver at age 65 sets a deadline by which annual proof of disability must remain valid, making the timing of submissions relevant to maintaining benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.95</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="06ec4160-b42d-4ff4-aade-db4dc4398172">
      <data key="d3">Reaching age 65 stops the premium waiver regardless of ongoing disability status, meaning even if someone hasn't recovered, the waiver expires at age 65 unless otherwise specified.</data>
      <data key="d4">independent termination</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d" target="2a484835-c2d5-4916-aaf4-80a161c5cdca">
      <data key="d3">The premium waiver ends at age 65, limiting its applicability over time, whereas the right to convert to an individual whole life policy allows permanent coverage regardless of future health—but only if exercised promptly after losing group coverage. The timing constraints differ significantly between these two benefits.</data>
      <data key="d4">complements</data>
      <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
      <data key="d5">0.65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="224e8a19-bc5a-4a83-8c3c-cd15a6bf15a1" target="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">ends at age 65</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="44ab8c9e-d378-4bb6-bcb7-c9fe713c7f27" target="be8734b0-e512-496b-b54a-fa04e79d616d">
      <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
      <data key="d4">enforces end of waiver at age 65</data>
    </edge>
